      "description": "Phone enquiry code for this property: 1360<br/>Disclaimer: We have been furnished with the above information<br/>This roomy one bedroom apartment is ideal for anyone looking to live on the city fringe. The large lounge room overlooks the fenced courtyard that in turn overlooks the river. The main features are:<br/><br/>•\tFloorboards<br/>•\tNew kitchen, coffee machine<br/>•\tNew bathroom, shower and full size, deep bath<br/>•\tFreshly painted<br/>        Dyson stick vacuum cleaner<br/>•\tShared laundry on-site<br/>•\tBus stop and bike path are literally at the door<br/>•\tThree blocks from Botanical Gardens<br/>•\tSituated on the Yarra River<br/>•\tWalking distance to Chapel Street, Toorak Road and train stations<br/>•\tLawson Grove Café is just around the corner<br/>        Internet provided<br/><br/>. One single rattan day bed and one single pull out bed provided. Other beds to be provided by tenant.<br/>No TV provided.<br/><br/>Phone enquiry code for this property: 1360",
